# Implementation Plan - Local LLM Sovereignty

The user wants to ensure the system runs **entirely** on their own LLM (Iron Brain / Sovereign Model), with no external API calls (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini).

## Audit Findings
- **[swarm/core/llm.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/llm.ts)**:
  - [MultiLLMClient](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/llm.ts#126-191) tries `ironBrain` (Local), then `sovereignModel` (Local), then `sovereignLLM` (Synthetic/Local), and finally [Antigravity](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/llm.ts#20-125) (Quantum/External?).
  - [AntigravityLLMProvider](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/llm.ts#20-125) routes requests via `Base44` audit logs. This might be an external path if Base44 is external.
- **[swarm/core/brain_v1.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/brain_v1.ts)**: Likely the interface to the local GGUF model.
- **[swarm/core/sovereign_model.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/sovereign_model.ts)**: Likely the interface to Ollama or similar.
- **[swarm/core/sovereign_llm.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/sovereign_llm.ts)**: A "Synthetic Layer".

## Proposed Changes
1.  **Enforce Local Priority in [swarm/core/llm.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/llm.ts)**:
    - Ensure `ironBrain` and `sovereignModel` are the *only* active paths if "TRUE_AI_INDEPENDENCE" is set.
    - Disable [Antigravity](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/llm.ts#20-125) routing if it implies external dependency, unless it's a confirmed local loop.
2.  **Verify `Iron Brain` Configuration**:
    - Check [brain_v1.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/brain_v1.ts) to ensure it talks to `localhost` (e.g., port 8000 or 11434).
3.  **Update Workflows**:
    - Remove `OPENAI_API_KEY`, `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`, `GEMINI_API_KEY` from [autonomous_swarm.yml](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/.github/workflows/autonomous_swarm.yml) to prevent accidental usage.
    - Set `TRUE_AI_INDEPENDENCE: "true"` as a global default.

## Verification
- **Manual Test**: Run [scripts/reality_pulse.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/scripts/reality_pulse.ts) and check logs to confirm it uses `Iron Brain` or `Sovereign Model` and does *not* try to contact OpenAI/Anthropic.
- **Code Check**: Grep for `fetch('https://api.openai.com` etc. to ensure no hidden calls.
